From 53bb35b28d5684eef17c55ecdfcdbda558bb94ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Rywacki, Kamil" <kamil.rywacki@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2020 11:30:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-6698: Implement RED offload in pon qos driver

- Implement WRED support

Signed-off-by: Rywacki, Kamil <kamil.rywacki@intel.com>
---
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/Kconfig           |   1 +
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/pon_qos_tc_main.c |  13 +-
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/pon_qos_tc_main.h |   3 +
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/pon_qos_tc_qos.c  | 126 ++++++++++++
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/pon_qos_tc_qos.h  |  25 +++
 drivers/net/datapath/pon_qos/pon_qos_tc_red.c  | 269 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 431 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

